WEBVTT

00:08:59.702 --> 00:09:03.038
nuclear power is too expensive.

00:09:03.872 --> 00:09:05.416
I'm going to take that one.

00:09:06.458 --> 00:09:09.712
A little weird to say something
is too expensive

00:09:09.712 --> 00:09:13.132
to save the future of our species,

00:09:13.132 --> 00:09:15.593
but I get it, cost matters.

00:09:16.468 --> 00:09:17.678
Here's the thing.

00:09:17.678 --> 00:09:20.681
We know how to make clean energy cheaper.

00:09:21.181 --> 00:09:22.891
It's not rocket science.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:26.895
You build the same thing
over and over and over.

00:09:27.938 --> 00:09:32.192
Solar, 10 years ago, was also
considered "too expensive,"